const invEntries10=inventoryEntries;inventoryEntries=function(source){if(!['fridge','freezer'].includes(source))return invEntries10(source);const stock=inventoryStock(source),out=[];for(const k of Object.keys(foodTypes))for(let n=stock[k]||0;n>0;n-=PACK_STACK)out.push({source,kind:'stock',key:k,count:Math.min(n,PACK_STACK)});for(const kind of ['fish','creature'])for(const ref of inventoryArray(source,kind))out.push({source,kind,key:ref.species,ref,count:1});return out;};
